  "Lifetime = 10 Gyr × (M/M☉)^(−2.5).",
  "1 M☉: 10 Gyr. 2 M☉: 1.77 Gyr. 5 M☉: 0.18 Gyr.",
  "A cluster's turn-off mass therefore dates it: stars above that mass have already left the main sequence."
